  "notes": "\n\n Column Management: You can now rename columns and reorder them however you like — giving you full control over how your data is structured and displayed.\n\n Background Process Indicator: Active background processes now show in the footer, so you always know when something is running without having to check elsewhere.\n\n Project Preview: See what's inside a project before opening it. The project selection screen now shows a preview of the project's contents, helping you pick the right one faster.\n\n Device Health Check Fix: Added device-level diagnostics to the initialization flow, making it easier to troubleshoot login and authentication issues.\n\n S3 Sync Fixes: Column statistics are now properly stored for S3-synced data, and synced files correctly appear as tabs in the sidebar instead of being silently skipped.\n\n Google Sheets Tab Recovery: If a pinned Google Sheet gets renamed at the source, OrcaSheets now recovers the tab automatically instead of losing track of it.",
